 (name "Adafruit Metro RP2350 (Shield Headers)")
 (description "Shield-side header footprint for the Adafruit Metro RP2350 with PSRAM (#6267).\nMetro DC jack: 5.5/2.1 mm centre-positive, about 6-17 V (the MEAN WELL GST60A12 12 V supply plugs in directly).\nVerify the D22/D23 positions against the Metro silkscreen (they sit where an Uno has D12/D13).")
